# Server build only (the GitHub Pages build has no server: visitors paste their
# own key at the bottom of the page instead). Copy to `.env.local` to use.
#
# One AI key, read only on the server (app/api/ai/route.ts), never sent to the browser.
# Either a Google AI Studio key (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey) — Gemini reads
# plans, Nano Banana makes realistic renders —
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# …or a kie.ai key (https://kie.ai/api-key):
# KIE_API_KEY=
#
# Optional kie.ai model overrides:
# KIE_READER_MODEL=gemini-3-pro      # reads the plan
# KIE_CHAT_MODEL=gemini-3-flash      # free-form commands
# KIE_RENDER_MODEL=nano-banana-pro   # "Make realistic"
# KIE_RENDER_RESOLUTION=2K           # 1K | 2K | 4K
# (Google model ids are discovered from the key's model list automatically.)
